<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss July trade figures due on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Swiss July trade figures due on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss provisional import and export figures for July will be released on August 19 at 2:15 p.m.(1215 GMT), the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>Revised figures for June showed a surplus of 329.7 million Swiss francs on imports of 8,614.0 million and exports of 8,948.4 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
